{"id":"e8786f04f0989d4c","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-thread-through-square.md","title":"ZFC Thread Through Square","display":"df-zfc-thread-through-square — ZFC Thread Through Square","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-thread-through-square","aliases":["58-df-zfc-thread-through-square"],"display":"df-zfc-thread-through-square — ZFC Thread Through Square","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-thread-through-square"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-thread-through-square</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-thread-through-square — ZFC Thread Through Square"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c0a77f933fa6045\" href=\"?note=2c0a77f933fa6045\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread\">58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\vec C,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(D,\\vec C,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (canonical square-thread predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}thread\\text{-}through\\text{-}square} \\vdash \\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}thread\\text{-}through\\text{-}square} \\vdash \\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A thread is defined for a coherent candidate sequence. Requiring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\\)</span> here would be contradictory because that upstream predicate already includes the nonexistence of a thread.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread","status":"resolved","id":"2c0a77f933fa6045","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\vec C,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}thread\\text{-}through\\text{-}square} \\vdash \\mathrm{ThreadThroughSquare}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,\\vec C,\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3509","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-thread-through-square.md|58-df-zfc-thread-through-square]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2c0a77f933fa6045"]}